//! Iceberg integration: a SQLite-backed catalog (via [`iceberg-catalog-sql`])
//! with auto-created `siglake.events` table, an append path that writes
//! Parquet via Iceberg's `DataFileWriter` + `fast_append` commit, and a
//! DataFusion table provider for queries.
//!
//! For local dev the catalog metadata lives in a single SQLite file
//! (`{warehouse}/_catalog.db`) and Parquet/manifest files are written to
//! the local filesystem under `{warehouse}/`. Phase 4 will swap the
//! `LocalFsStorageFactory` for an S3 factory and the SQLite URI for a
//! Postgres URI; the `IcebergContext` API stays the same.

